Zsh itself
----------

What follows is the license file shipped with the Zsh 5.9 sources, reproduced
verbatim. The grant above is modeled on it.

Its paragraph about GNU-licensed shell functions does not apply to this project.
zsh-wasm compiles zsh's C sources and loadable modules only. No files from zsh's
shell-function library are compiled into `zsh.wasm` or shipped in the npm
package — the build embeds no data files into the binary's filesystem at all.

----------------------------------------------------------------------

Unless otherwise noted in the header of specific files, files in this
distribution have the licence shown below.

However, note that certain shell functions are licensed under versions
of the GNU General Public Licence.  Anyone distributing the shell as a
binary including those files needs to take account of this.  Search
shell functions for "Copyright" for specific copyright information.
None of the core functions are affected by this, so those files may
simply be omitted.

